# For the Netflix module (modules/netflix): Chromium with Widevine, which
# Netflix's player needs, and cage, which gives the browser the screen when
# there is no desktop. Without recommends, like the rest, so the Pi's Chromium
# tweaks (rpi-chromium-mods), the GPU drivers and the fonts that Chromium only
# recommends are named here. os/build.sh skips all of it with MP240_NETFLIX=0.
chromium rpi-chromium-mods libwidevinecdm0 libgl1-mesa-dri fonts-liberation
cage
